# Loge: Prolog smoke test

```elixir
root = Path.expand("..", __DIR__)

Mix.install([
  {:loge, path: Path.join(root, "loge"), override: true},
  {:loge_prolog, path: Path.join(root, "loge_prolog")},
  {:kino_loge, path: Path.join(root, "kino_loge")}
])
```

## Solving

Expected: **Yes**, a table with `Z` = `ann` and `pat`.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(
  Loge.Prolog.Engines.Swipl,
  "parent(tom, bob).\nparent(tom, liz).\nparent(bob, ann).\nparent(bob, pat).\n\ngrandparent(X, Z) :- parent(X, Y), parent(Y, Z).\n\n?- grandparent(tom, Z).\n",
  answers: 0,
  time_limit: 10
)
```

Expected: **No**, no table.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(
  Loge.Prolog.Engines.Swipl,
  "parent(tom, bob).\nparent(tom, liz).\nparent(bob, ann).\nparent(bob, pat).\n\ngrandparent(X, Z) :- parent(X, Y), parent(Y, Z).\n\n?- grandparent(ann, _).\n",
  answers: 1,
  time_limit: 10
)
```

What the program prints is the Output tab. Expected: **Yes**, Output `hello, world`.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJzd2lwbCIsImxhbmd1YWdlIjoicHJvbG9nIiwib3B0aW9ucyI6eyJhbnN3ZXJzIjoxLCJ0aW1lX2xpbWl0IjoxMH0sInNvdXJjZSI6ImdyZWV0KE5hbWUpIDotIGZvcm1hdChcImhlbGxvLCB+d35uXCIsIFtOYW1lXSkuXG5cbj8tIGdyZWV0KHdvcmxkKS5cbiIsInZhcmlhYmxlIjoiIn0","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(
  Loge.Prolog.Engines.Swipl,
  "greet(Name) :- format(\"hello, ~w~n\", [Name]).\n\n?- greet(world).\n",
  answers: 1,
  time_limit: 10
)
```

Expected: **Timeout** after two seconds.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJzd2lwbCIsImxhbmd1YWdlIjoicHJvbG9nIiwib3B0aW9ucyI6eyJhbnN3ZXJzIjoxLCJ0aW1lX2xpbWl0IjoyfSwic291cmNlIjoibG9vcCA6LSBsb29wLlxuXG4/LSBsb29wLlxuIiwidmFyaWFibGUiOiIifQ","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(Loge.Prolog.Engines.Swipl, "loop :- loop.\n\n?- loop.\n", answers: 1, time_limit: 2)
```

## Includes

A **Logic Source** cell binds the program to `family`; a cell that consults it with
`:- [family].` asks a query of its own. Expected: **Yes**, `Z` = `ann` and `pat`.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJsYW5ndWFnZSI6InByb2xvZyIsInNvdXJjZSI6InBhcmVudCh0b20sIGJvYikuXG5wYXJlbnQodG9tLCBsaXopLlxucGFyZW50KGJvYiwgYW5uKS5cbnBhcmVudChib2IsIHBhdCkuXG5cbmdyYW5kcGFyZW50KFgsIFopIDotIHBhcmVudChYLCBZKSwgcGFyZW50KFksIFopLlxuIiwidmFyaWFibGUiOiJmYW1pbHkifQ","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.SourceCell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
family =
  Loge.source(
    :prolog,
    "parent(tom, bob).\nparent(tom, liz).\nparent(bob, ann).\nparent(bob, pat).\n\ngrandparent(X, Z) :- parent(X, Y), parent(Y, Z).\n"
  )
```

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJzd2lwbCIsImlucHV0IjpudWxsLCJsYW5ndWFnZSI6InByb2xvZyIsIm9wdGlvbnMiOnsiYW5zd2VycyI6MCwidGltZV9saW1pdCI6MTB9LCJzb3VyY2UiOiI6LSBbZmFtaWx5XS5cblxuPy0gZ3JhbmRwYXJlbnQodG9tLCBaKS5cbiIsInZhcmlhYmxlIjoiIn0","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(Loge.Prolog.Engines.Swipl, ":- [family].\n\n?- grandparent(tom, Z).\n",
  answers: 0,
  time_limit: 10,
  includes: %{"family" => family}
)
```

## Linting

Expected: under the editor, `Y` is a singleton (warning, on `Y`) and line 3 has a syntax
error; evaluating raises `Loge.Error` with the syntax error.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJzd2lwbCIsImxhbmd1YWdlIjoicHJvbG9nIiwib3B0aW9ucyI6eyJhbnN3ZXJzIjoxLCJ0aW1lX2xpbWl0IjoxMH0sInNvdXJjZSI6InAoWCkgOi0gcShYLCBZKS5cbnEoYSwgYikuXG5yKCA6LSBzLlxuXG4/LSBwKGEpLlxuIiwidmFyaWFibGUiOiIifQ","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

